          List of files distributed with B-Tree Filer 5.41

FILER disk
----------------
read.me           - latest news
packing.lst       - this list of files
lharc.exe         - dearchiving program for LZH files
lharcman.lzh      - documentation for LHARC.EXE
filer.lzh         - archive containing B-Tree Filer single user source code
  basesupp.pas        DOS/Windows compatibility unit
  bigsort.pas         sorting demonstration program
  browser.inc           included in browser.pas
  browser.pas         file browsing unit
  btdefine.inc        conditional defines affecting all units
  carrconv.pas        converts dBase character arrays to Pascal data types
  convert.pas         shows how to convert Database Toolbox data to Filer
  db2isam.pas         example program to convert any dBase file to Filer
  dbimpexp.pas        conversion of dBase files to/from Filer fileblocks
  dbimpexp.in1          included in dbimpexp.pas
  dbimpexp.in2          included in dbimpexp.pas
  dbimpexp.doc        documentation for dBase conversion
  emsheap.cfg           included in emsheap.pas
  emsheap.pas         EMS heap manager unit
  emssupp.pas         low level EMS support unit
  errors              listing of all Filer error codes
  example.pas         single-user fileblock example routines
  fastupd.541         changes from previous version to this one
  filer.cfg           configuration constants for filer.pas
  filer.inc             included in filer.pas
  filer.mak           make file for single user B-Tree Filer
  filer.pas           the main fileblock management unit
  fixtovar.pas        unit to convert fixed length records to variable length
  isam2db.pas         example program to convert a Filer file to dBase
  isambase.inc          included in filer.pas
  isamlow.inc           included in filer.pas
  isamtool.pas        miscellaneous routines supporting filer unit
  isamwork.inc          included in filer.pas
  iscompat.pas        version 5.0x backwards compatibility unit for filer
  msort.pas           merge sort unit
  msortems.inc          included in msort.pas
  msortinf.inc          included in msort.pas
  netdemo.pas         filer demonstration program (depends on Turbo Professional)
  numkeys.asm           assembly language for numkeys.obj
  numkeys.obj           linked into numkeys.pas
  numkeys.pas         numeric keys unit
  read.1st            full news to update the printed manual
  rebuild.pas         fileblock rebuilding unit
  reorg.pas           fileblock reorganization unit
  simpdemo.pas        filer demonstration program (standalone)
  tpalloc.pas         heap allocation unit for blocks >64K
  tpcmd.pas           command processing unit used by browser.pas
  tpdefine.inc        conditional defines for tpxxxx.pas units
  vrcompat.pas        version 5.0x backwards compatibility unit for vrec
  vrebuild.pas        vrec fileblock rebuilding unit
  vrec.pas            variable length record support unit
  vreorg.pas          vrec fileblock reorganization unit
util.lzh          - archive containing B-Tree Filer utility programs
  upgrade.exe         program to upgrade Filer 5.0x programs to 5.21 or later
  dbox.upg            substitution file for DatabaseToolbox
  filer.upg           substitution file used by UPGRADE.EXE
  printdoc.exe        program to paginate and print text files

DEMO/HELP disk
----------------
netdemo.exe       - precompiled version of netdemo demonstration program
address.dat       - data file for netdemo
address.ix        - address file for netdemo
bigsort.exe       - precompiled version of bigsort demonstration program
btfhelp.lzh       - archive containing help text and popup help utility
  pophelp.exe         popup help utility
  makehelp.exe        help compiler
  *.txt               text files describing the various B-Tree Filer units

NET disk (supplied only with Network version of B-Tree Filer)
----------------
netbonus.lzh      - BONUS file: NetWare function calls, misc NetBIOS
                    functions, NetWare print queue management, network
                    messaging tests, test network loading with fileblock
                    operations
netinfo.exe       - precompiled version of netinfo demonstration program
nreceive.exe      - precompiled version of nreceive demonstration program
nsend.exe         - precompiled version of nsend demonstration program
netfiler.lzh      - archive containing B-Tree Filer network source code
  ipxspx.asm          assembly language for ipxspx.obj
  ipxspx.inc            included in netware.pas
  ipxspx.obj            linked into netware.pas
  ixpspxd.pas         IPX/SPX access DLL for Windows
  isamnwrk.inc          included in filer.pas
  isnetsup.inc          included in filer.pas
  mesexamp.pas        NetWare and NetBIOS message demonstration program
  nbchatw.pas         NetBIOS chat demonstration program for Windows
  netbios.inc           included in netbios.pas
  netbiosw.inc          included in netbios.pas
  netbios.pas         NetBIOS access unit
  netbiosd.pas        NetBIOS access DLL for Windows
  netexamp.pas        network fileblock example routines
  netfiler.mak        make file for network B-Tree Filer
  netinfo.pas         NetWare and NetBIOS service demonstration program
  netsema.pas         used by netdemo.pas
  netware.inc           included in netware.pas
  netware.pas         NetWare access unit
  netwarew.inc          included in netware.pas
  nreceive.pas        network file transfer demonstration program - receiving
  nreceivw.pas        network file transfer demo for Windows
  nsend.pas           network file transfer demonstration program - sending
  nsendw.pas          network file transfer demo for Windows
  share.inc             included in share.pas
  sharew.inc            included in share.pas
  share.pas           DOS 3.x SHARE access unit
  windpmi.pas         Windows DPMI access unit

BONUS disk
----------------
read.me!          - file describing bonus files
extend.lzh        - increase number of file handles even for DOS <3.3
fbrowse.lzh       - object-oriented fileblock browser for use with OPRO
msortp.lzh        - MSORT rewritten to take advantage of protected mode
obrowse.lzh       - OOP fileblock browsers for Windows/TV/OPRO
oofiler.lzh       - fileblock management objects
prealloc.lzh      - data and index file preallocation unit
reindex.lzh       - fileblock reindexing units
